<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-1763] Zeppelin hangs if I repeatedly select and deselect note name</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1763</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Zeppelin hangs if I repeatedly select and deselect note name.&lt;br/&gt;
And then browser&apos;s memory usage continues to increase.&lt;br/&gt;
Finally browser hangs too. dead. the end.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Please refer attached GIF.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment>&lt;p&gt;OS : windows 10&lt;br/&gt;
Browser : chrome 54.0.2840.99&lt;/p&gt;</environment>
