                            <comment id="15732128" author="marchpig" created="Thu, 8 Dec 2016 12:53:18 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I could reproduce this issue as well.&lt;br/&gt;
I guess that too many unnecessary websocket calls cause this issue.&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;tt&gt;$scope.sendNewName()&lt;/tt&gt; calls &lt;tt&gt;websocketMsgSrv.updateNote()&lt;/tt&gt; without checking whether the notename is changed or not.&lt;br/&gt;
Fortunately, my recent pull request &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/1733&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/1733&lt;/a&gt; can resolve this issue.&lt;br/&gt;
Thanks!&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
