&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1763&quot; title=&quot;Zeppelin hangs if I repeatedly select and deselect note name&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-1763&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-1763&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Prevent duplicate $scope.$on(&apos;setNoteMenu&apos;) calls&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
	&lt;ol&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;
		&lt;ol&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;What is this PR for?&lt;br/&gt;
    It&apos;s to fix the issue &apos;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1763&quot; title=&quot;Zeppelin hangs if I repeatedly select and deselect note name&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-1763&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-1763&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&apos; (Zeppelin hangs if I repeatedly select and deselect note name).&lt;br/&gt;
    When the note name was changed, there was a problem that the &apos;setNoteName&apos; listener was registered in duplicate and occupied resources. &lt;br/&gt;
    To fix it, I moved the function that registers the listener out of initNoteBook()&lt;/li&gt;
